              owner in OverSpec, 2026-11-28: good. Not on real hardware.

  Replay      33,008 frames identical across t1, t2 and t3. All 12 hook sites
              reached. Four CPU speeds. 64 hide cases. Eight negative controls
              detected.

  Emulator    OverSpec desktop: all eight colour and cheat combinations
              reached the Buchu fight from the patch menu; the owner played it
              from the menu, 2026-11-28: good.

  Coverage    Enhanced t3 checked 1,144,576 uploaded fighter bytes in 15,004
              frames. All 105 sheet poses checked separately.

  Hardware    Not tested

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
